{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234070","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1123407001:1":{"text":"It's time to see what awaits me on the long road ahead.","source_cn":"是时候离开了，能跟我上路的东西有多少呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A57D0DA6174131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123407002:1":{"text":"Chippy still doesn't understand... Do you really have to go?","source_cn":"满满还是不理解……为什么一定要这么坚决呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AB34622B71DAEA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123407003:1":{"text":"When the clans first moved into the desert, resources were scarce, and survival was hard-fought. Scarcity led to countless battles among the Maulers.","source_cn":"在沙漠的拓荒时代，因为资源贫瘠，生存是各个氏族必须面对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D29A6226CADA9CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123407004:1":{"text":"The victorious clans survived, and the defeated faded into the sands. All notions of benevolence and morality meant nothing. Only the strongest thrived.","source_cn":"赢的氏族活下来，输的氏族被淘汰，一切仁义道德都是多余的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B6A38ED269A0747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123407005:1":{"text":"Kruger never lived through these times, and so he cannot fathom these concepts.","source_cn":"克鲁格并未经历过那个年代，所以他根本不懂那意味着什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D11613B8C24A9AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1123407005":{"text":"Kruger never lived through these times, and so he cannot fathom these concepts.","source_cn":"克鲁格并未经历过那个年代，所以他根本不懂那意味着什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D11613B8C24A9AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123407006:1":{"text":"When I was young, I contemplated these things often as you do now, but in time, you will come to see that those who have devoted their lives to battle cannot withstand the ravages of time.","source_cn":"我孩童的时候也像你一样想过这些，但渐渐地你会发现，一生...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5D1F5107523C0E87","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"When I was young, I contemplated these things often as you do now, but in time, you will come to see that those who have devoted their lives to battle cannot withstand the ravages of time.","female":"When I was young, I contemplated these things often as you do now, but in time, you will come to see that those who have devoted their lives to battle cannot withstand the ravages of time.","variant_male_record_index":"127695","variant_female_record_index":"127696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123407007:1":{"text":"My kin all feel ashamed as they age. When they can no longer bear arms, self-exile becomes an inevitable fate.","source_cn":"我的亲人，都在自然老去中感到耻辱。当他们无法再拿起武器...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68484FF1447043DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1123407008:1":{"text":"And now it's my turn.","source_cn":"现在轮到我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D0F28A713061A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1123407008":{"text":"And now it's my turn.","source_cn":"现在轮到我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D0F28A713061A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123407009:1":{"text":"In my experience, peace is always fleeting. Conflict can erupt at any moment, and the Grimmaw Clan must never be caught off guard.","source_cn":"对于我的生命来说，和平永远是短暂的，争斗随时都可能爆发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A0D6D1FDB523A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1123407011:1":{"text":"If you wish to respect and understand me, then follow me no longer.","source_cn":"如果你们听懂了，就不要再跟过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB977C5E9E1D7DB84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1123407012:1":{"text":"You are good and kind people but please... leave me be. Let this feeble old man depart in peace.","source_cn":"我知道你们都是好孩子，但……再别跟过来，让我这个无力的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x654976F964D566CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1123407013:1":{"text":"No...","source_cn":"不……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE859DC76A12C3EB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1123407014:1":{"text":"Farewell, and... thank you.","source_cn":"再见，谢谢你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEB11C3E34E07F0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"The Warsong Festival abolished war.","source_cn":"战歌节已经取缔了战争","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC34AA77DF6613684","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Warsong Festival abolished war.","female":"The Warsong Festival abolished war.","variant_male_record_index":"64924","variant_female_record_index":"64925","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1123407010:1":{"text":"Honor... No, what we need are more young brave warriors, not ones who fill their heads with ideas of honor.","source_cn":"荣誉，不……我们需要的是更多年轻勇敢的战士，而不是挂满...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6550235D0D30D3CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"More to honor than fighting.","source_cn":"战斗不是取得荣誉的唯一途径","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB9FD388402525EAB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"More to honor than fighting.","female":"More to honor than fighting.","variant_male_record_index":"64926","variant_female_record_index":"64927","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"To fight is one's fate...","source_cn":"听起来，战斗才是宿命","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDDF24EF9DAE87C3E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"To fight is one's fate...","female":"To fight is one's fate...","variant_male_record_index":"64920","variant_female_record_index":"64921","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"It's different now.","source_cn":"现在已经改变了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x578D57565ECE78BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's different now.","female":"It's different now.","variant_male_record_index":"64922","variant_female_record_index":"64923","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈什尔":{"text":"Hashir","source":"哈什尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}